# Public assistant (Zoiko iD chat). Server-side only; never expose with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Base URL of the assistant service. Local default: http://localhost:8210
# Leave unset to use the built-in assistant (lib/assistant-local.ts), which needs one of the keys below.
# Use 127.0.0.1, not localhost: on Windows, Node tries IPv6 first and every call stalls for seconds.
# The assistant service must list this site's origin in ZID_ASSISTANT_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (e.g. http://localhost:3010).
# ZID_ASSISTANT_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8210
GROQ_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
